WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.118
How much do you pay your salesperson to call the wrong companies?

00:00:05.118 --> 00:00:13.150
An hour of calling costs the same, whether the company fits perfectly or will never
become a customer.

00:00:13.150 --> 00:00:18.976
Before the call, you have already researched, filtered and found a number.

00:00:18.976 --> 00:00:22.441
How much of that work starts again tomorrow?

00:00:22.441 --> 00:00:24.724
You know your best customers.

00:00:24.724 --> 00:00:31.575
How many similar companies never reach your list because you do not know where to
look?

00:00:31.575 --> 00:00:38.031
Old lists are scattered, with duplicates, missing information and forgotten notes.

00:00:38.031 --> 00:00:40.394
Your team asks for a new list.

00:00:40.394 --> 00:00:45.118
You buy one and may pay again for companies you already had.

00:00:45.118 --> 00:00:52.283
Even a won customer can consume your time with discounts, complaints and endless
follow-up.

00:00:52.283 --> 00:01:00.000
How much attention goes to the wrong customer while the right one is still missing
from your list?

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:06.110
This is where BelgoBase starts: with your experience, instead of another arbitrary
list.

00:01:06.110 --> 00:01:10.068
Here a workplace fruit supplier searches around Mechelen.

00:01:10.068 --> 00:01:13.193
The conversation makes his criteria concrete.

00:01:13.193 --> 00:01:16.040
He reviews the proposal before searching.

00:01:16.040 --> 00:01:23.106
This search returns 239 companies: postcode 2800, at least 20 full-time equivalents.

00:01:23.106 --> 00:01:26.555
These are real results for you to review.

00:01:26.555 --> 00:01:33.200
Workforce size alone does not show how many people actually work at the office.

00:01:33.200 --> 00:01:34.934
We export the selection.

00:01:34.934 --> 00:01:37.245
This is the actual Excel output.

00:01:37.245 --> 00:01:41.869
Missing contact details can be researched separately afterwards.

00:01:41.869 --> 00:01:47.720
Existing lists can also be combined and cleaned up, as shown in the second video.

00:01:47.720 --> 00:01:51.304
Which wrong companies cost your team time today?

00:01:51.304 --> 00:01:53.619
Bring your situation to a demo.

00:01:53.619 --> 00:01:58.920
See where your selection can be sharper before you start calling again.
